{"4327400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sushi Sewers", "steam_appid": 4327400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/fe90c4f69066590c9373e489e00decdf.avif?t=1780081648\" width=74 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sewers never sleep.<br>Neon lights flicker inside the dark holes, machines bleed, and something dark is crawling out of the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a <strong>top-down, cyberpunk bullet-heaven</strong> where survival means embracing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/84e539fdc0d33bd22814bcb08cd67716.poster.avif?t=1780081648\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/84e539fdc0d33bd22814bcb08cd67716.webm?t=1780081648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/84e539fdc0d33bd22814bcb08cd67716.mp4?t=1780081648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against <strong>relentless enemy hordes</strong> in fast, arena-based combat inspired by <i>Vampire Survivors</i>. Attacks fire automatically, letting you focus on movement, positioning, and using devastating primary weapons as the screen fills with bullets, blades, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>randomized upgrades</strong>, stack powerful multipliers, and unlock broken builds that turn you from prey into a walking catastrophe. Survive long enough and the city won’t just fear you — it will collapse around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/19238604635615079797f0c2a628cc9d.avif?t=1780081648\" width=791 height=325 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Heaven chaos</strong> with hundreds of enemies on screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-attacking combat</strong> focused on movement and decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena survival</strong> where danger comes from every direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack-and-slash power fantasy</strong> with your primary weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/e82ed1faeead34197efdac4b5cb9f868.avif?t=1780081648\" width=1115 height=319 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike runs</strong> with randomized upgrades every session</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackable buffs &amp; synergies</strong> that radically change gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent meta-progression</strong> to grow stronger between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't just move around -</strong> attack with the two primary weapons</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/e36e34e123c575521098921ac3062341.avif?t=1780081648\" width=727 height=324 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk dark-fantasy setting</strong> blending neon tech and occult horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized pixel art</strong> with high-contrast, flashy effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive, dystopian atmosphere</strong> driven by speed and chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast restarts</strong> designed for “one more run” addiction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/9bf1c1feeaf62fe20b24909dac29e5c8.avif?t=1780081648\" width=618 height=226 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get meat from killing </strong>mutant fish and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare the meat into sushi </strong>in your sushi restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell the sushi </strong>for money and buffs</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/fe90c4f69066590c9373e489e00decdf.avif?t=1780081648\" width=74 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sewers never sleep.<br>Neon lights flicker inside the dark holes, machines bleed, and something dark is crawling out of the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a <strong>top-down, cyberpunk bullet-heaven</strong> where survival means embracing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/84e539fdc0d33bd22814bcb08cd67716.poster.avif?t=1780081648\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/84e539fdc0d33bd22814bcb08cd67716.webm?t=1780081648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/84e539fdc0d33bd22814bcb08cd67716.mp4?t=1780081648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against <strong>relentless enemy hordes</strong> in fast, arena-based combat inspired by <i>Vampire Survivors</i>. Attacks fire automatically, letting you focus on movement, positioning, and using devastating primary weapons as the screen fills with bullets, blades, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>randomized upgrades</strong>, stack powerful multipliers, and unlock broken builds that turn you from prey into a walking catastrophe. Survive long enough and the city won’t just fear you — it will collapse around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/19238604635615079797f0c2a628cc9d.avif?t=1780081648\" width=791 height=325 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Heaven chaos</strong> with hundreds of enemies on screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-attacking combat</strong> focused on movement and decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena survival</strong> where danger comes from every direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack-and-slash power fantasy</strong> with your primary weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/e82ed1faeead34197efdac4b5cb9f868.avif?t=1780081648\" width=1115 height=319 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike runs</strong> with randomized upgrades every session</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackable buffs &amp; synergies</strong> that radically change gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent meta-progression</strong> to grow stronger between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't just move around -</strong> attack with the two primary weapons</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/e36e34e123c575521098921ac3062341.avif?t=1780081648\" width=727 height=324 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk dark-fantasy setting</strong> blending neon tech and occult horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized pixel art</strong> with high-contrast, flashy effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive, dystopian atmosphere</strong> driven by speed and chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast restarts</strong> designed for “one more run” addiction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/extras/9bf1c1feeaf62fe20b24909dac29e5c8.avif?t=1780081648\" width=618 height=226 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get meat from killing </strong>mutant fish and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare the meat into sushi </strong>in your sushi restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell the sushi </strong>for money and buffs</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A fast-paced cyberpunk bullet-heaven where neon chaos, dark power, and endless enemy swarms collide. Survive the waves, create the strongest builds, and become unstoppable.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327400/9fa19f048b441a552c89b0cd3a154f70faff92ce/header.jpg?t=1780081648", "ca